                  {
                    tag: "message",
                    speaker: "Dacyn",
                    text: _("Unfortunate, but at least we have some. Ogres are unskilled fighters but much cheaper to equip than our other soldiers, and thus <i><b>cost much less gold to recall.</b></i>"),
                  },
